        "original_id": "9e7afd0e-3315-55c0-b1bb-6c05ddc94fea",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Phoenix Suns, Miami Heat, National Basketball Association (NBA)\n- People: Goran Dragić, P. J. Tucker, Markieff Morris, Marcus Morris, Channing Frye\n- Events: 2013–14 Phoenix Suns season, 2013–14 NBA season\n- Roles: Point guard, Shooting guard\n\nFacts:\n- The 2013–14 NBA season was the Phoenix Suns' 46th season in the NBA.\n- When the Phoenix Suns began the 2013–14 regular season, Goran Dragić, P. J. Tucker, Markieff Morris, and Marcus Morris were the only players returning from the previous season's playing roster.\n- Channing Frye had been on the previous Phoenix Suns team, but he did not play any games that season because of a life-threatening heart ailment.\n- Goran Dragić was born on 6 May 1986.\n- Goran Dragić is a Slovenian professional basketball player for the Miami Heat of the NBA.\n- Goran Dragić plays both point guard and shooting guard.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "f06a581a-2374-5b93-afb6-537caa722f4b",
        "text": "Page: 2013–14 Phoenix Suns season. Sentence: The 2013–14 NBA season was the Phoenix Suns' 46th season in the NBA.\nPage: 2013–14 Phoenix Suns season. Sentence: When the Suns began the regular season, Goran Dragić, P. J. Tucker, Markieff Morris, and his twin brother Marcus Morris were the only players returning from playing with last season's team (while Channing Frye was still on last season's team, he didn't play any games due to a life-threatening heart ailment he had at the time).\nPage: Goran Dragić. Sentence: Goran Dragić (born 6 May 1986) is a Slovenian professional basketball for the Miami Heat of the National Basketball Association (NBA).\nPage: Goran Dragić. Sentence: He plays at both the point guard and shooting guard positions.",
